yCQJe5tD9A63jzDmA&oe=69C27F53"}, {"file_name": "screens \u2013 4.png", "id": "439126458253242", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001697_439126464919908_1939579221717236708_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SIeNv74rksEQ7kNvwHigbs2&_nc_oc=Adou0EwpU-VoCBRR20bB7s9pJ_mnG2GswGy-oD6TM7-yZz9aLJIpGkCqRLg5vDqAufQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwhUJ-YwkdhbELnPmNw2QivM_bM9VgzNqa__LN8YOCjxg&oe=69C28E90"}, {"file_name": "screens.png", "id": "771101150621784", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569471_771101160621783_7591652676362700724_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OnfrLbht0kYQ7kNvwGLcsnD&_nc_oc=AdoxYOkLXcszF7mQnxWi9v2y6WZBkFdCR-e2P41eMyHpdb7Yt-RPnfqBrIC0lMv3d3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw7V5tTvEjR7u2TTtWANNo8lU9TdIvD60efU7LPkpLHhg&oe=69C277E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Outcasts of Dungeon Magic World Rogue Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Being in the role of a brave wanderer, help dwarfs to defend their kingdom fortress from a rampaging mob of beastly invaders. Captured dwarfs need help, and they have something to offer you as a reward.\nBattle enemies through a story-based campaign across dungeon and evolve your combat skills to achieve better results.\nFeatures:\n- Procedurally generated dungeons \u2013 Twisting passages, long halls and wide-open chambers all need a hero to clear them.\n- Story-based Campaign \u2013 Fend off monsters across acts to discover the mysterious power behind their relentless assaults.\n- Companion System - Free and protect allies from captivity and use their combat power to your advantage.\n- 9 Different Enemies \u2013 Including scavengers, ghouls and a whole bunch of ugly orcs.", "short_description": "It is a third person fantasy action game, where in the role of a brave wanderer, help dwarfs to defend their kingdom for